  - interactable: {fileID: 1275988532}
    objectiveTitle: "ZEM\u0130N\u0130 OKU"
    objectiveDetail: "K\u0131r\u0131k cama yakla\u015Fmadan hal\u0131n\u0131n a\xE7\u0131k
