  - interactable: {fileID: 93784794}
    objectiveTitle: AYAKLARINI KORU
    objectiveDetail: "Ayakkab\u0131 \xE7iftini do\u011Frudan Deniz'in ayaklar\u0131na
      s\xFCr\xFCkle."
    completionSubtitle: "Deniz ayakkab\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 giyiyor; k\u0131r\u0131k
      par\xE7alara kar\u015F\u0131 ayaklar\u0131 korunuyor."
    delayAfter: 2.5
  - interactable: {fileID: 10118657}
    objectiveTitle: CAN'A YARDIM ET
    objectiveDetail: "Can'\u0131n ba\u011Fc\u0131klar\u0131nda bas\u0131l\u0131 tutup
      gev\u015Fek k\u0131sm\u0131 toparla."
    completionSubtitle: "Can'\u0131n ayakkab\u0131lar\u0131 da haz\u0131r. \u0130ki
      karde\u015F art\u0131k zeminde g\xFCvenle ilerleyebilir."
    delayAfter: 2.5
  - interactable: {fileID: 220730727}
    objectiveTitle: "AFET \xC7ANTASINI AL"
    objectiveDetail: "\xC7antay\u0131 d\xFC\u015Fen e\u015Fyalardan uzak taraf\u0131ndan
